      "ArticleTitle": "[Successful management of a patient with pain and dyspnea from bone metastasis and lymphangitis carcinomatosa after surgery for non-small cell lung cancer (NSCLC) in whom optimal dosages of transdermal fentanyl were determined by titration with fentanyl injection, and oxycodone hydrochloride].",
